<title>USA: Fed says Monday's coupon pass totaled $1.924 bln.</title>
<headline>Fed says Monday's coupon pass totaled $1.924 bln.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Reserve said it bought $1.924 billion of securities during its coupon pass operation Monday.</p>
<p>The Fed said it bought all coupons maturing from May 15, 1999, to March 31, 2002.  It said delivery would be made Tuesday.</p>
<p>(( -- N.A. Treasury Desk, 212-859-1660))</p>
</text>
